%% frame: UC5 A2: the last-seat join and the expiry race for one team (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Join as txJ : PaidGroupDealService
    participant Exp as txE : GroupDealExpiryService
    participant Repo as :PaidGroupDealRepository
    participant GD as :GroupDeal

    Note over Join,GD: A2, at B7: a paid join for the last seat (UC4, @fig-a-uc04-ds-admit) and expireOne (@fig-a-uc05-ds-expire) reach the same team
    par txJ, UC4 settlement transaction
        Join->>Repo: lockDeal(dealId)
    and txE, expireOne transaction
        Exp->>Repo: lockDeal(dealId)
    end
    Note over Repo: the team row lock (lock 1) admits one transaction at a time; the other waits for its commit
    alt txJ locks first, and its clock is still before expireTime
        Repo-->>Join: Optional of GroupDeal (OPEN)
        Join->>GD: joinPaid(paid, alreadyMember, now)
        GD-->>Join: PaidAdmission, teamCompleted: true
        Note over Join: B1-B4, then COMMIT releases lock 1
        Repo-->>Exp: Optional of GroupDeal (SUCCEEDED)
        Exp->>GD: expire(now)
        GD-->>Exp: BizException DEAL_CLOSED, so expireOne returns false
    else txE locks first
        Repo-->>Exp: Optional of GroupDeal (OPEN)
        Note over Exp: B7-B10, then COMMIT releases lock 1
        Repo-->>Join: Optional of GroupDeal (EXPIRED)
        Join->>GD: joinPaid(paid, alreadyMember, now)
        GD->>GD: requireJoinWindow(now)
        GD-->>Join: BizException DEAL_CLOSED, so compensation_required and a refund owed (UC4 A6)
    end
